---
description: Croatian full female name — one given name and one surname (Ana Horvat). The surname is drawn from hr.person.lastName, the SAME list a man's is drawn from, not from a feminine list: Croatian surnames do not inflect for gender, so Ana and her brother Marko are both Horvat. That is the whole reason this pack has no person/female/lastName — compare pl, where the equivalent file must read the feminine -ska list.
generator: tdc
locale: hr
---
<sequence name="p">
  <gen name="f" type="template" value="hr.person.female.firstName"/>
  <gen name="l" type="template" value="hr.person.lastName"/>
</sequence>
<data>${{p.f}} ${{p.l}}</data>
